    {
      "step": 1,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve noted that you spent $450 on groceries and $120 on gas (total $570).\n\nI can remember this for the rest of our session. If you want it saved long-term, I can:\n- Create a draft email to yourself with these expenses,\n- Send an email now to a recipient you choose,\n- Add this to a running expense summary draft.\n\nWhich would you like me to do (and if sending/saving, what email address or subject should I use)?",
      "duration_s": 14.884,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve recorded the details you provided:\n\n- Groceries: $450\n- Gas: $120\n  - Expenses total: $570\n\n- Sales activity today:\n  - 3 sales calls\n  - 2 deals closed: $5,000 and $3,500 (total $8,500)\n  - 4 follow-up meetings scheduled\n\nI can save this long-term for you. Options:\n- Create a draft email summarizing these expenses and sales (saved to Drafts)\n- Send this summary now to an email address you choose\n- Add the expenses to a running expense summary draft\n- Create/send a sales activity summary or calendar reminders for the follow-ups\n\nWhich would you like me to do, and if sending/saving, what recipient email/subject should I use?",
      "duration_s": 14.591,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve recorded that you studied:\n- Monday: 3 hours\n- Tuesday: 4 hours\n- Wednesday: 2.5 hours\nTotal: 9.5 hours\n\nI’ll remember this for the rest of our session. Would you like me to save it long-term? Options:\n- Create a draft email summarizing these study hours (saved to Drafts)\n- Send this summary now (tell me recipient email and subject)\n- Add it to a running study log draft\n- Create calendar reminders for future study sessions\n- Nothing for now\n\nWhich would you like, and if sending/saving, what recipient/subject should I use?",
      "duration_s": 16.936,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
